{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":11,"ref":"2-chronicles 22:11","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"fr","chapter":22,"translation":"Et Yehoshava`at, fille du roi, prit ⟨את⟩ Yoash, fils d'Akhaziahou ; elle le déroba ⟨את⟩ lui du milieu des fils du roi, ceux mis à mort ; et elle le plaça ⟨את⟩ lui et ⟨את⟩ sa nourrice dans la chambre des lits ; et elle le cacha — Yehoshava`at, fille du roi Yehoram, épouse de Yehoyada le cohen — car elle ⟨était⟩ sœur d'Akhaziahou, devant la face d'Athaliahou, et elle ne le mit pas à mort.","tokens":[{"surface":"ותקח","gloss":"Et elle prit"},{"surface":"יהושבעת","gloss":"Yehoshava`at"},{"surface":"בת","gloss":"fille"},{"surface":"המלך","gloss":"du roi"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"Yoash"},{"surface":"יואש","gloss":"Yoash"},{"surface":"בן","gloss":"fils"},{"surface":"אחזיהו","gloss":"d'Akhaziahou"},{"surface":"ותגנב","gloss":"elle déroba"},{"surface":"אתו","gloss":"⟨את⟩ lui"},{"surface":"מתוך","gloss":"du milieu"},{"surface":"בני","gloss":"des fils"},{"surface":"המלך","gloss":"du roi"},{"surface":"המומתים","gloss":"ceux mis à mort"},{"surface":"ותתן","gloss":"et elle le plaça"},{"surface":"אתו","gloss":"⟨את⟩ lui"},{"surface":"ואת","gloss":"et ⟨את⟩","marks":"sa nourrice"},{"surface":"מינקתו","gloss":"sa nourrice"},{"surface":"בחדר","gloss":"dans la chambre"},{"surface":"המטות","gloss":"des lits"},{"surface":"ותסתירהו","gloss":"et elle le cacha"},{"surface":"יהושבעת","gloss":"Yehoshava`at"},{"surface":"בת","gloss":"fille"},{"surface":"המלך","gloss":"du roi"},{"surface":"יהורם","gloss":"Yehoram"},{"surface":"אשת","gloss":"épouse"},{"surface":"יהוידע","gloss":"de Yehoyada"},{"surface":"הכהן","gloss":"le cohen"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"car"},{"surface":"היא","gloss":"elle"},{"surface":"היתה","gloss":"⟨était⟩"},{"surface":"אחות","gloss":"sœur"},{"surface":"אחזיהו","gloss":"d'Akhaziahou"},{"surface":"מפני","gloss":"devant la face de"},{"surface":"עתליהו","gloss":"Athaliahou"},{"surface":"ולא","gloss":"et elle ne"},{"surface":"המיתתהו","gloss":"le m